3239: /// Wraps a [_BlockRenderer] so that the underlying block widget (and its
3240: /// [_TextSelectionSurface] children, geometry registration, and text-layout
3241: /// cache) stay mounted even when scrolled out of the viewport — but only when
3242: /// [keepAlive] is true. Used to keep the caret block and selection endpoints
3243: /// alive under editor virtualisation, so the caret and selection
3244: /// highlight always paint and the geometry registry always knows their box.
3245: ///
3246: /// Also drives incremental rebuild: a block is only re-rendered when its
3247: /// content changed ([blockChanged]) *or* when the selection / caret / IME
3248: /// composition touches it. A pure caret move inside a different block leaves
3249: /// this block's cached child intact, avoiding the inline-span rebuild that
3250: /// would otherwise run for every block on every keystroke.

